          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7516506",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the two people up ahead",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751650901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751650901": {
            "id": "751650901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Illimani, you seem to have gained some weight again — congrats!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650902"
            ]
          },
          "751650902": {
            "id": "751650902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Haha, thanks, Suriqui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650903"
            ]
          },
          "751650903": {
            "id": "751650903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Good news, by the by — I just talked another skinny person out of dieting the other day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650904"
            ]
          },
          "751650904": {
            "id": "751650904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Oh, nice! That's awesome!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650905"
            ]
          },
          "751650905": {
            "id": "751650905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Hey, what about you? Been eating well these days?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650907",
              "751650909"
            ]
          },
          "751650907": {
            "id": "751650907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "That's what I like to hear — eat more, get nice and chubby.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650910"
            ]
          },
          "751650910": {
            "id": "751650910",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Oh, by the way, Illimani, this person's jar-smashing record is insane — just a little short of my best.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650911"
            ]
          },
          "751650911": {
            "id": "751650911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "#{M#He}{F#She} even challenged me here. Did pretty well, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650912"
            ]
          },
          "751650912": {
            "id": "751650912",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Wow, not bad! Didn't expect you to be so good — almost beat the two of us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650913"
            ]
          },
          "751650913": {
            "id": "751650913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "#Honestly, if {M#he}{F#she} gains a bit more weight, {M#he}{F#she} might actually beat us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650914"
            ]
          },
          "751650914": {
            "id": "751650914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Yeah, totally possible. But honestly, you're still a bit too skinny — you've got room to bulk up. That said...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650915"
            ]
          },
          "751650915": {
            "id": "751650915",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "I approve of you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650916"
            ]
          },
          "751650916": {
            "id": "751650916",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "I approve of you too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650917"
            ]
          },
          "751650917": {
            "id": "751650917",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "But seriously, you should eat more at every meal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650918"
            ]
          },
          "751650918": {
            "id": "751650918",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "No skipping meals, no dieting — we'd be so disappointed if you did."
          },
          "751650909": {
            "id": "751650909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "That's no good. Nothing's more important than eating properly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7516502",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751650201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751650201": {
            "id": "751650201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Ah, valiant passerby, since you've come all the way to Teteocan, I take it you're someone seeking strength, aren't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650202"
            ]
          },
          "751650202": {
            "id": "751650202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Perhaps you've already seen some that the Collective of Plenty would call strong. Hah. Bunch of meatheads, they are, if you ask me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650203"
            ]
          },
          "751650203": {
            "id": "751650203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "But you? You're pretty lean — not yet one of those gym addicts obsessed with their daily lifts and bench-presses, I'm sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650204"
            ]
          },
          "751650204": {
            "id": "751650204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "I'll tell you what, all of that is a scam. Don't be fooled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650207"
            ]
          },
          "751650207": {
            "id": "751650207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Well, maybe things aren't as simple as that. But muscle worship and the claim that a warrior's strength flows from them? Absolute nonsense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650208"
            ]
          },
          "751650208": {
            "id": "751650208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Know this! The heroes of old could never have had bodies that were nothing but skin, bones, and muscle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650209"
            ]
          },
          "751650209": {
            "id": "751650209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "They lived in far harsher conditions than we do today, where survival and defense were paramount. To endure real combat, they would've definitely maintained a healthy layer of fat for protection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650210"
            ]
          },
          "751650210": {
            "id": "751650210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "As such, their physique would've been more like mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650211"
            ]
          },
          "751650211": {
            "id": "751650211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Yes, this slightly chubby build I've got is what the heroes of old would've had — a body that balances impact and agility.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650212"
            ]
          },
          "751650212": {
            "id": "751650212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "But sadly, the people of this tribe just can't see the truth. Ugh, idiots all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650213"
            ]
          },
          "751650213": {
            "id": "751650213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "You don't look entirely convinced... Hmm, how about this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650214"
            ]
          },
          "751650214": {
            "id": "751650214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "Try out the jar-smashing challenge I've constructed! I set this location up to train myself, but I wouldn't mind letting you have a go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650215"
            ]
          },
          "751650215": {
            "id": "751650215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Suriqui",
            "text": "You'll see just how powerful a larger build can be in real combat once you've given this a shot!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7516504",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751650401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751650401": {
            "id": "751650401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Hey, valiant passerby over there — yes, you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650402"
            ]
          },
          "751650402": {
            "id": "751650402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Sigh, you're so skinny... Have you been eating properly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650403",
              "751650407"
            ]
          },
          "751650403": {
            "id": "751650403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "No matter what your reasons or struggles might be, the first rule is: you must eat well!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650408"
            ]
          },
          "751650408": {
            "id": "751650408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Since you've made it to Teteocan, you've probably already seen the warriors from Collective of Plenty, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650409"
            ]
          },
          "751650409": {
            "id": "751650409",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Out of the goodness of my heart, let me give you a piece of advice: never trust those guys who are obsessed with preaching about muscles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650410"
            ]
          },
          "751650410": {
            "id": "751650410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "The fat that the Archon blessed us with is a precious gift. Giving up all the delicious food and losing your fat just to chase after some flashy muscles?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650411"
            ]
          },
          "751650411": {
            "id": "751650411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "That's the dumbest thing ever. Even the forest boars would pity you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650412"
            ]
          },
          "751650412": {
            "id": "751650412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "And honestly, if we're talking about what looks good, this whole muscle-worship thing only became popular in the last few decades.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650413"
            ]
          },
          "751650413": {
            "id": "751650413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "My grandpa told me that back in his day, people actually preferred a slightly fuller figure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650414"
            ]
          },
          "751650414": {
            "id": "751650414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "So, don't let anyone mislead you into going down the wrong path to lose weight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650415"
            ]
          },
          "751650415": {
            "id": "751650415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "But, if one day you end up like my relatives from Collective of Plenty and decide to lose weight in the name of strength...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650416"
            ]
          },
          "751650416": {
            "id": "751650416",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Here's something else to remember: when it comes to agility, warriors with a slightly chubby build can also be as nimble as fish. But when it comes to strength, those skinny guys are no match for us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650417"
            ]
          },
          "751650417": {
            "id": "751650417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "If you need proof, just look at the jars on this training ground.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650418"
            ]
          },
          "751650418": {
            "id": "751650418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "With my build, I can easily <color=#00E1FFFF>sprint through without breaking a single jar</color>. I bet even the skinny ones couldn't pull that off with this level of agility, don't you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650419"
            ]
          },
          "751650419": {
            "id": "751650419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Oh, I can see it — you're trying not to laugh, huh? Fine... I know you don't believe me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650420"
            ]
          },
          "751650420": {
            "id": "751650420",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Come on, give it a try! Run through this training ground as fast as you can, but be sure <color=#00E1FFFF>not to break any of the jars</color>!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751650421"
            ]
          },
          "751650421": {
            "id": "751650421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Let's see how well you do — and whether you can beat my record."
          },
          "751650407": {
            "id": "751650407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Illimani",
            "text": "Well, that's not what I meant... But if you're really starving, I do have some grilled meat in my bag. Anyway, let's set that aside for now..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
